WEBVTT

00:01:28.036 --> 00:01:32.716
as I start again from scratch
to win her over.

00:01:33.516 --> 00:01:36.436
I do, of course, eventually win her over,

00:01:36.436 --> 00:01:40.836
but it was a lot of time and effort wasted

00:01:40.836 --> 00:01:44.396
and ultimately, yet another hit
to my confidence.

00:01:45.356 --> 00:01:46.716
And the thing is,

00:01:46.716 --> 00:01:49.316
I have other experiences like that one.

00:01:49.356 --> 00:01:52.516
And I know plenty
of other folks who do too.

00:01:52.876 --> 00:01:57.756
So today I want to reflect
on how stereotyping,

00:01:57.796 --> 00:02:03.116
unconscious bias and societal privilege
operates in such a way